   "evidence": "At #8 the strategist had $28 and paid $10 for Grabber with a 2-joker board, which dropped it to $18. That gave up the $25 interest tier and the money to find +Mult. Five hands of roughly 100-150 points (when Flower Pot doesn't fire) still fall short of 1,500.",
