   "evidence": "#10: at $27 it passed on Fibonacci ($8) to stay at $25, even though the boss had read 47% one purchase earlier. #15-16: it spent the Buffoon pack pick on To the Moon instead of a chips or Mult joker, even though its own note said the only chips source was expiring. #17: it left the shop at exactly $25 with Planet Merchant and other offers unbought. The board without conditions (Blue +~80 chips, +4 Mult, level 1 Pair/Two Pair) made about 600-700 per hand against the 500 per hand The House needed.",
   "cost": "The run. A ~$5-8 interest gain was traded for the scoring margin that would have beaten the ante 2 boss."
