   "evidence": "At ante 3 there was $13 of surplus at 17 and $11 at 25. That money went to Fibonacci [eternal] for $8 at 20, which fires only on A/2/3/5/8, Square Joker for $4 at 25, and two $5 rerolls at 19 and 26. At 23 a Celestial Jumbo was passed on to stay at $25. Two Pair reached the ante 3 boss at level 2, against a target of 3-5.",
