   "evidence": "25 bought Square Joker at 0 chips (+4 chips a hand, worth nothing this ante). At 29, with clear chance 27%, the style still forced exactly-4-card Two Pair plays to grow it. The playbook says slow starters come too late, and that survival overrides everything.",
