  [1] Once a rank-conditional xMult joker lands (Triboulet, Photograph, face-card payoffs, Baron, etc.), every deck-editing consumable should raise the density of the trigger ranks. Use Strength (J→Q, Q→K), Death (copy a K/Q onto a low card) and Hanged Man (destroy 2s-7s). Pick these over Wheel of Fortune, suit changers, or enhancements on non-trigger ranks. Aim for at least 12 trigger cards, or remove 8+ low cards, before the next boss. Avoid jokers that add dead, non-pairing cards (Marble Joker's Stone cards).
